# Only web/ ships to Vercel. Everything below is the Python platform, its
# tooling, and the docs -- none of it is served, and shipping pyproject.toml is
# what made Vercel auto-detect this repo as a Python backend and fail the build
# with "No python entrypoint found". vercel.json pins framework/build/install
# explicitly; this file removes the trigger as well.

gauntlet/
tests/
tools/
rulepacks/
flows/
waivers/
ui-ux-pro-max/
runs/

pyproject.toml
*.md
.github/
